  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born amidst the toxic runoff of the old Flocker Toxic factories, 'ShockHazard' learned to navigate the hazardous underbelly of Subchain City. The stage diving days are behind him but he held onto some momentoes - now he uses his intimate knowledge of the city's hidden passages and knack for surviving the mosh pit for more nefarious purposes.",
    "class": "Hazardous Recon",
    "name": "ShockHazard",
    "personality": "Irreverent and resourceful, ShockHazard has a dark sense of humor. He's always looking for an angle, and while he'll work with a flock, trust isn't exactly his strong suit. He has an almost morbid fascination with electricution.",
